        "metadata": {
            "uuid": "BCM_Lighting_@7d7ffa2c",
            "description": [
                "ExteriorLighting software on the Body Control Module (BCM). Controls vehicle body electronics (lights, locks, etc.).",
                "",
                "Turn signal state machine (state_machines/turn_signals.py). Each blink tick toggles on/off every 1.0 s (blink_interval_in_sec default), i.e. 0.5 Hz, below the 1.0 to 2.0 Hz of COMP_REQ_BCM_TURN_BLINK:",
                "",
                "```mermaid",
                "stateDiagram-v2",
                "  [*] --> Off",
                "  Off --> Left: turn_left",
                "  Off --> Right: turn_right",
                "  Left --> Right: turn_right",
                "  Right --> Left: turn_left",
                "  Left --> Off: turn_off",
                "  Right --> Off: turn_off",
                "  Off --> Hazard: hazard_pressed",
                "  Left --> Hazard: hazard_pressed",
                "  Right --> Hazard: hazard_pressed",
                "  Hazard --> Left: hazard_pressed [stalk left]",
                "  Hazard --> Right: hazard_pressed [stalk right]",
                "  Hazard --> Off: hazard_pressed [stalk off]",
                "  state Left {",
                "    LeftOn --> LeftDark: blink",
                "    LeftDark --> LeftOn: blink",
                "  }",
                "  state Right {",
                "    RightOn --> RightDark: blink",
                "    RightDark --> RightOn: blink",
                "  }",
                "  state Hazard {",
                "    HazardOn --> HazardDark: blink",
                "    HazardDark --> HazardOn: blink",
                "  }",
                "```",
                "",
                "Beam state machine (state_machines/beams.py):",
                "",
                "```mermaid",
                "stateDiagram-v2",
                "  [*] --> Off",
                "  Off --> DRL: drl",
                "  DRL --> Low: low",
                "  Low --> DRL: drl",
                "  DRL --> Off: off",
                "  Low --> Off: off",
                "```"
            ],
            "name": "BCM_Lighting",
            "source": "remotive_car/platform/remotive-car.platform.yaml",
            "version_schema": "4.6.2"
        }
    }
